            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Cumin? (जीरकम्, jīrakam.) Mustard? (सर्षपः, sarṣapaḥ.) Asafoetida? (हिंगु, hiṅgu.) Sesame? (तिलः, tilaḥ.) A chickpea? (चणकः, caṇakaḥ.) A meal? (भोजनम्, bhojanam.) A curry? (व्यञ्जनम्, vyañjanam.) Food? (आहारः, āhāraḥ.) Eating? (अशनम्, aśanam.) A small pitcher? (कलशी, kalaśī.) A conch? (शंखः, śaṅkhaḥ.) A flute? (वेणुः, veṇuḥ.) A mridanga drum? (मृदंगः, mṛdaṅgaḥ.) An anklet? (नूपुरम्, nūpuram.) An earring? (कुण्डलम्, kuṇḍalam.) Wages? (वेतनम्, vetanam.) A debt? (ऋणम्, ṛṇam.) Profit? (लाभः, lābhaḥ.) Loss? (हानिः, hāniḥ.) Trade? (व्यापारः, vyāpāraḥ.)"
